OL,3,AAustralian MP has critical injuries
OL,4,Aafter being hit by car in what PM calls
OL,5,A'deliberate act'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian MP Helen Haines has been hit
OL,8,Fby a car in what Prime Minister Anthony
OL,9,FAlbanese calls "a deliberate act" -
OL,10,Fhere's what we know so far
OL,12,F"This wasn't an accident - there was a
OL,13,Fdeliberate act, it would appear,"
OL,14,FAlbanese tells Australian media
OL,16,FPolice say Haines has been taken to
OL,17,Fhospital with "critical injuries" and
OL,18,Fthey're investigating whether it was
OL,19,F"intentional" - statement in full
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
