OL,3,AAustralian MP has critical injuries
OL,4,Aafter being hit by car in what PM calls
OL,5,A'deliberate act'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaines was reportedly near her regional
OL,8,Foffice in Wangaratta, Victoria, when
OL,9,Fshe was struck - her family thank "the
OL,10,Fswift assistance of bystanders" and
OL,11,Fhealth workers who helped
OL,13,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,14,FTarrawingee, was arrested at the scene
OL,15,Fby a passer-by
